  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Distribution of Hygiene Kits to Flood Affectees</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will be implemented in 10 selected villages of Union Councils (UCs) Gara Baloch &amp; Pai District Tank, province Khyber Pakhtunkhwa Pakistan. The Provincial Disaster Management Authority (PDMA) Peshawar has declared these 10 villages as severely affected by flash flood.  The project will provide hygiene kits and information to 500 families with the aim to improve their living conditions as these items were lost in the flooding and which are at risk of diseases.</narrative>
  </description>
